# This is the x86 (32-bit / Win32) CMake build tree (generated by cmake -A Win32 here).
# Keep the FOLDER present on GitHub so the build location exists after a clone, but
# never commit its generated contents (avp.sln, *.vcxproj, CMakeCache.txt, CMakeFiles/,
# avp.dir/, Release/, etc.). Regenerate them locally with CMake.
*
!.gitignore
!*.vcxproj
!*.filters
!*.user
!*.sln